&lt;p data-start=&quot;428&quot; data-end=&quot;506&quot;&gt;Retaining at-risk customers through active listening and tailored solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;507&quot; data-end=&quot;585&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;509&quot; data-end=&quot;585&quot;&gt;Coordinating with tutors and booking lessons to keep every class on track.&lt;/p&gt;
